5,0,1,talk,Yumi,,"Hello everyone! I'm so excited to play with you all! Since it's the first day, let's all be friends and try our best to find the werewolf together. Does anyone have any ideas on how we should start?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... hello. I agree with Yumi. I think... maybe we should just talk and get to know each other first? I'm not very good at this, but I'll do my best to help.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"I agree that observation is the best starting point. Since we have no information yet, we should focus on how everyone communicates and reacts. Let's keep the conversation open and see if any inconsistencies emerge.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is such a pleasure to meet you all. Let us be patient and kind to one another as we begin. I believe that if we speak with warmth and sincerity, the truth will reveal itself in time.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,"Hello everyone. It's nice to meet you all. I agree with Shizue; maintaining a kind and harmonious atmosphere will help us work together. I'm a bit nervous, but I'll do my best to support everyone!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"Everyone is so kind! It makes me feel really happy. @Asuka, you mentioned looking for inconsistencies—that sounds like a great plan! I'll try my best to be helpful and keep everyone's spirits up while we observe!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think Asuka's plan is a good one. I'll try to listen carefully to what everyone says. I'm sorry if I'm too quiet... I just want us all to get along and find the wolf.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"There is no need to apologize for being quiet, Daisuke. Silence can be just as informative as speech. I will be paying attention to the balance between those who are overly eager and those who are hesitant.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is lovely to see such a thoughtful discussion. @Daisuke, please do not worry about your silence; your gentle presence is more than enough. We shall all find our own way to contribute to our little community.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, please don't feel pressured to speak more than you're comfortable with. We all have different ways of helping. I'll be right here to support you and everyone else as we figure this out together.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"Thank you, everyone, for being so supportive of Daisuke! It really shows how wonderful you all are. Since we're all in agreement about observing, I wonder if anyone has a specific ""gut feeling"" yet, or if we're all still just watching?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I don't really have a gut feeling yet. It's too early, right? I'm just... trying to process everything. I think it's better to wait for more information before we start guessing.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"I agree with Daisuke. Relying on ""gut feelings"" this early is illogical and can lead to baseless accusations. We should prioritize concrete evidence and the Seer's future findings over intuition to avoid making a mistake.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"Asuka is quite right to remind us of the value of patience. It would be such a shame to let a small misunderstanding lead us astray. Let us keep our hearts open and our minds clear, shall we?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,I agree with Asuka and Shizue. It's important that we don't rush into suspicions. Let's continue to be patient and trust that the truth will come to light as we share more with each other.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Yumi,,"You're all so wise! I'll definitely remember to stay patient and look for real clues. I'm really glad we're all starting off on such a positive note! I'll see you all tomorrow. Goodnight, everyone!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Yumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,"Goodnight, everyone... I hope we all have a peaceful night. I'll do my best to be more helpful tomorrow. Thank you for being so kind to me.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Daisuke,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Asuka,,"I will continue to analyze our interactions. Let us hope the Seer's first divination provides us with a solid foundation for tomorrow's discussion. Goodnight, everyone.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Shizue,,"It has been a truly lovely first day. I shall wish you all a night of sweet dreams and peaceful rest. Please take care of yourselves, and I look forward to seeing your smiling faces tomorrow. Goodnight.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Midori,,"It was a wonderful first day getting to know you all. I feel much more relaxed now. I hope everyone has a restful night and that we can continue this harmony tomorrow. Goodnight, everyone!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
29,0,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
