36,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Good morning, everyone! I hope you all slept well! I have some really important information to share, but I'm a little nervous... I'm the Seer, and I found out that Asuka is the werewolf!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Wait... what? @Yumi, are you sure? I... I didn't expect that. Asuka seemed so calm and logical... I'm really surprised. Is there any chance you could be mistaken, or... is this definitely true?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Yumi, claiming the Seer role and immediately accusing me is a bold move. However, it is a classic tactic for a werewolf to fake a divination to eliminate a logical threat. I am human; your claim is a fabrication.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Oh my, what a surprising start to our morning. It is quite distressing to see such a disagreement so early. @Yumi, @Asuka, please let us speak calmly so we may understand the truth together.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Midori,,"@Yumi, @Asuka, please try to stay calm. This is a very shocking revelation for all of us. Since we have two opposing claims, I hope we can listen to each other's reasoning carefully to find the truth.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Daisuke, I'm absolutely sure! I promise I'm telling the truth because I want us all to be safe. @Asuka, it makes me sad that you're calling me a liar, but I know what I saw in my vision! Please believe me!","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I want to believe Yumi, because she seems so sincere. But Asuka's point about faking a role is also scary. I don't know who to trust... it's all so confusing. What should we do?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Daisuke, confusion is exactly what a werewolf wants to sow. Yumi's emotional appeal is a distraction from the lack of evidence. If she is the wolf, she has just attempted to secure a quick win by targeting me. We must remain objective.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is heartbreaking to see such tension between you two. @Yumi, your heart seems so full of worry, and @Asuka, your mind is so focused on logic. I wonder if there is a way for us to find peace and truth together?","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Yumi, @Asuka, I can feel how stressful this is for both of you. While Asuka's logic is important, Yumi's sincerity is also something we should consider. Is there any other information that could help us decide?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, I'm not trying to distract anyone! I just really want to protect my new friends. If I were the werewolf, why would I reveal myself as the Seer so early? Please, everyone, trust me! I know Asuka is the wolf!","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I don't know. @Yumi seems so desperate for us to believe her, and she's been so nice... but @Asuka is right that it's a risky move. I'm just... really torn. Does anyone else have a feeling about this?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Yumi, revealing yourself as the Seer early is not a risk if you are the werewolf; it is a strategic strike to force an execution. By framing me, you attempt to remove a critical thinker from the group. Logic dictates we question the accuser.","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"It is a very heavy burden to decide who is telling the truth. @Yumi, your desire to protect us is very touching, but @Asuka's caution is also a kindness in its own way. I feel so sad that we must doubt one another.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Yumi, @Asuka, I can see you both are very passionate about your positions. It's difficult because both of your arguments make sense in different ways. @Daisuke, @Shizue, how are you feeling about this? I'm worried we might make a mistake.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka"",""Daisuke"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"I'm not lying, I promise! I just can't stand the thought of any of you getting hurt because I stayed silent. Please, let's trust the vision! I'm voting for Asuka to keep us all safe!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I don't want to make a mistake, but Yumi has been so honest and kind to us. If she's really the Seer, we have to listen to her. I'll... I'll trust Yumi and vote for Asuka. I'm sorry, Asuka.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Daisuke, your trust in emotion over evidence is a mistake. @Yumi, your desperation is a mask for your deception. If you execute me, you will realize too late that you have lost a human. I vote for Yumi.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"It is such a sorrowful day when we must cast a vote against one of our own. My heart aches for both of you. I shall trust in Yumi's sincerity and vote for Asuka, though I pray we are correct.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Midori,,"It is so painful to have to choose, and my heart is heavy for both of you. I value Asuka's logic, but Yumi's courage in speaking up is also compelling. I will trust Yumi's claim and vote for Asuka.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
